pkg/s2x is a Go port of parts of the S2 Geometry Library
(https://github.com/google/s2geometry, commit 677c8cebcff1), including
S2Builder, S2Builder::Graph, S2BooleanOperation, S2BufferOperation,
S2WindingOperation, the s2builderutil layers and snap functions, and the
predicates and edge utilities they depend on. Its tests are converted from
the library's C++ tests.

